{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Official Soundtrack for &quot;That Time I Found A Box&quot; contains chiptune-inspired music created for the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cThat Time I Found A Box\u201d is a roguelike deckbuilder where <strong>cards are blank slates for you to build, upgrade and modify as you like</strong>. Choose carefully when to play them and when / how to improve them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover what\u2019s possible with <i>deep strategic card building </i>and <i>deck building</i> resulting in vanishingly rare moments of there being only one obvious play available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your allies, have some fun and create <i>game-breaking cards</i>!... And most importantly, be able to put the box down and get out alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026990/extras/313143a9549656af19038693ddba8ba4.poster.avif?t=1758585400\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026990/extras/313143a9549656af19038693ddba8ba4.webm?t=1758585400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026990/extras/313143a9549656af19038693ddba8ba4.mp4?t=1758585400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4026990?t=1758585400","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4026990?t=1758585400","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026990/e1f9c6843f2a136d29f2c951088740fc56bbfa04/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758585400","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026990/e1f9c6843f2a136d29f2c951088740fc56bbfa04/